{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_040tam_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_040tam_5000_situation", "source_sha256": "d923e455d7923790ea4926e0c2bc175c2373905932642af78ae34d4a6545090a", "ja": "商品PRのお仕事　撮影前", "zh": "商品宣传工作　拍摄前", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_040tam_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_040tam_5000_place", "source_sha256": "dc6e2aafeb9e125b69d1b143f05c66414e6e1a4f46c163a52a6d289efeef27c7", "ja": "学校", "zh": "学校", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_040tam_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_040tam_5001_p", "source_sha256": "f98353bb00f9f342e0346cf2ca5991232beb75abc76b9e742b52742110ee1399", "ja": "（小学生向けの文房具をPRする、という仕事が、\n環に入った。実際使っているところを撮影するそうだ）", "zh": "（环接到了一份为小学生宣传文具的工作，\n听说要拍摄她实际使用文具的样子。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_040tam_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_040tam_5002_040tam", "source_sha256": "8937bf8a65accecc0d5d5a8ee01bd6f2974edf393969507038613c38b695bd02", "ja": "みてみておやぶん！　面白そうな文房具がいっぱい！\nくふふ～♪　たまき、すっごく楽しみだぞ～！", "zh": "老大你看你看！有好多看起来很有意思的文具！\n嘿嘿～♪环超级期待哦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_040tam_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_040tam_5003_p", "source_sha256": "7771a1dbe89086dcc62abaf813f6948659122895a26f056c031df4d2400d42e8", "ja": "確かに色々あるな。何個か選んでくれって話だけど、\n環はどれがいいと思う？", "zh": "确实种类挺多的。说是让我们挑几个，\n环觉得哪个好？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_040tam_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_040tam_5004_040tam", "source_sha256": "223041a37eb2d176439baa535d757fee959204be5f3b2b79fdda83de924b1347", "ja": "えっと、あの筆箱、音が鳴ってカッコイイよ！\nあ、でもあっちの消しゴムも、形がたくさんで……。", "zh": "那个笔盒会发出声音，感觉好帅哦！\n啊，不过那边的橡皮也有好多种形状……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_040tam_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_040tam_5005_040tam", "source_sha256": "8aa72fac97bc39afd5bdfb69ae298127af7563b831d8ab594fffa1150528d098", "ja": "う～っ、ぜんぶ面白そうで、たまき選べないぞ～！\nおやぶん～！　どういうのがいいかな？", "zh": "呜～，看起来每个都好有趣，环选不出来啦～！\n老大～！选什么样的比较好呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_040tam_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_040tam_5006_p", "source_sha256": "262a0f7a4dad6bf315ee794765a8605d763a47fcf0931857bb4a6ffa5b252cd1", "ja": "うーん、そうだな、ここは……。", "zh": "嗯——这个嘛，该选……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_040tam_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_040tam_5007", "source_sha256": "af319f015d78fdfdd878d324335dca6b9738974943e2906d8251957efdad7fd4", "ja": "環が欲しいもの", "zh": "环想要的东西", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_040tam_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_040tam_5008", "source_sha256": "9d375afe1508315eb58636b93383c6a9faf678366a97a98141b573584f1e8909", "ja": "新作の商品", "zh": "新商品", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_040tam_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_040tam_5200_p", "source_sha256": "478c53c7f00632b22f45870d8a4d883a7f0d7ddcb131e25f0567554261fe3ae9", "ja": "やっぱり、環が欲しいって思ったものが、\nPRしやすいんじゃないかな？", "zh": "果然选环自己想要的商品，\n会比较好做宣传吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_040tam_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_040tam_5201_040tam", "source_sha256": "7851edc66485dfadeebe2df3f14a15d3a869db1709e9960e0c0b17f4d471e7de", "ja": "わかった！　じゃあ……\nこの『消える！　秘密の手紙セット』にする！", "zh": "知道啦！那就选这个……“会消失的秘密信件套装”！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_040tam_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_040tam_5202_040tam", "source_sha256": "54702081444e0fa16796c0245d9f21426a903d26aa8a9a131904e2b68c181173", "ja": "スパイみたいでカッコイイぞ！\nお仕事終わったら、おやぶんにも書いてあげるね！", "zh": "感觉像间谍一样，好酷啊！\n工作结束后，也给老大写一封吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_040tam_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_040tam_5300_p", "source_sha256": "478c53c7f00632b22f45870d8a4d883a7f0d7ddcb131e25f0567554261fe3ae9", "ja": "やっぱり、環が欲しいって思ったものが、\nPRしやすいんじゃないかな？", "zh": "果然选环自己想要的商品，\n会比较好做宣传吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_040tam_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_040tam_5301_040tam", "source_sha256": "013766aa2a0e96cacefdc103484755f5ad4b1221a27377a8690eb46da0fc2fed", "ja": "たまきが欲しいのかぁ、うーん……。\nじゃあこれ、『いろんな形が書ける定規』にする！", "zh": "环想要的啊，嗯……  \n那就选这个，“能画出各种形状的尺子”！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_040tam_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_040tam_5302_040tam", "source_sha256": "114420ea5482b9c94e0905f4798a258e5d4c4294acca4491256dccf52368ad68", "ja": "形がカッコイイから、\n頭につけたらレッドみたいだぞ～！　くふふ♪", "zh": "样子很帅气，\n戴在头上的话就像红战士一样哦～！嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_040tam_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_040tam_5500_p", "source_sha256": "dc0ca3d6cbf1ba620434a4c061fa6ab4abd4769fe7131c4a088912d046c19787", "ja": "ここは、新作の商品がいいんじゃないか？\n会社側も、やっぱりその方が嬉しいと思うし。", "zh": "还是选新出的商品比较好吧？\n我想厂商那边肯定也会更高兴的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_040tam_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_040tam_5501_040tam", "source_sha256": "53e8ee9b4d7749a34ed87b3e9f8288e88116937b927e027128c8519a4166006f", "ja": "じゃあ、そうする！　えっと、一番新しいのは……\nあっ、この『どうぶつスタンプセット』だって！", "zh": "那就这么办！呃，最新的是……\n啊，是这个“动物印章套装”！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_040tam_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_040tam_5502_040tam", "source_sha256": "6f574fab7e4c6e33c848a4071cc242a8bab76c1a081c976348ae2814af1f58f6", "ja": "動物のとかいっぱいある！　あっ……このマンモス、\nおやぶんにちょっと似てるかも！　くふふ♪", "zh": "有好多动物图案的！啊……这个猛犸象，\n好像有点像老大！咕呼呼♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_040tam_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_040tam_5600_p", "source_sha256": "dc0ca3d6cbf1ba620434a4c061fa6ab4abd4769fe7131c4a088912d046c19787", "ja": "ここは、新作の商品がいいんじゃないか？\n会社側も、やっぱりその方が嬉しいと思うし。", "zh": "还是选新出的商品比较好吧？\n我想厂商那边肯定也会更高兴的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_040tam_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_040tam_5601_040tam", "source_sha256": "fc937caca9f53b1b2ecaf7fb0059c9f9cf7f493dd07229bbf356eb71ce508d1e", "ja": "新作？　それって、この『ラメペンセット』のこと？\nわっ、すごいぞ～！　キラキラ光るんだって！", "zh": "新品？你说的是这个“闪粉笔套装”吗？\n哇，好厉害啊～！听说还能闪闪发光呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_040tam_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_040tam_5602_040tam", "source_sha256": "2058d032a9336145cf46356fe6b04a0adee891bc3219352774fe2cb5536a23a6", "ja": "そうだ！　おやぶん、名刺かして！\nおやぶんの名刺、たまきがかっこよくしてあげる！", "zh": "对了！老大，把名片借给我！\n玉树帮老大的名片装饰得帅气一点！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
